<section class="sp-page-hero"><div><span class="sp-badge">Pilot-ready architecture · honest production story</span><h1>Enterprise Readiness</h1><p>Culltron Smart Port Flow is designed as an enterprise AI operations agent for smart ports and freight logistics. It is demo-ready and connector-ready today; live integrations require approved pilot credentials and production hardening.</p></div><a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" href="/demo-access">Start judge demo</a></section>

<section class="sp-card"><h2>Market-readiness checklist</h2><div class="sp-table-wrap"><table class="sp-table"><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Status</th><th>Evidence / next step</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach (var row in rows) { <tr><td>@row.Item1</td><td><span class="sp-badge">@row.Item2</span></td><td>@row.Item3</td></tr> }</tbody></table></div></section>

<div class="sp-grid sp-grid--3 sp-mt"><article class="sp-card"><h2>Demo Ready</h2><p>Identity role paths, protected demo screens, fleet/driver execution loop, Gemini/fallback agent console, governance checks, mobile API and public product pages are available for judges.</p></article><article class="sp-card"><h2>Connector Ready</h2><p>IPMS/TOS/gate/fleet/GPS/WhatsApp integrations are represented as pilot connector paths and field mappings. No live customer integration is claimed.</p></article><article class="sp-card"><h2>Production Hardening</h2><p>Before production: customer security review, SSO, secrets vault, rate limits, observability, DR, SLA, data retention, penetration testing and approved pilot credentials.</p></article></div>

<section class="sp-card sp-mt"><h2>Pilot pathway</h2><ol class="sp-timeline"><li>NDA/data-sharing agreement.</li><li>Identify systems: IPMS/TOS/gate/fleet/GPS/WhatsApp.</li><li>Map fields and data quality rules.</li><li>Build sandbox connector using synthetic + approved pilot data.</li><li>Run supervised pilot with human-approved actions.</li><li>Validate KPIs: queue time, idling minutes, CO₂, ETA reliability and driver confirmation rates.</li><li>Complete production hardening before autonomous or live-scale rollout.</li></ol></section>

<section class="sp-card sp-mt"><h2>Honest limitations</h2><ul class="sp-list"><li>No live Transnet, IPMS, TOS, WhatsApp production or GPS integration is claimed in this demo.</li><li>Gemini is used only when GEMINI_API_KEY and Gemini__Enabled=true are configured.</li><li>WhatsApp live sending requires approved Meta credentials and approved test recipients.</li><li>All demo actions use synthetic data and visible audit records.</li></ul></section>
